#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The ceiling is {ceiling}."
msgstr "Предел — {ceiling}."

#. placeholders: {owed}, {ceiling}
msgid ""
"You owe {owed}. A quarter of every settlement goes to it. The ceiling is "
